silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_09_bridges_gov_mereology_presheaf_sections_02_cross_paper_bridge_mereology_concrete_anchor_10_owneracknowledges#owner_acknowledges silm:hasLongDescription "The owner_acknowledges is the owner inclusion arrow seeding the cocone leg into Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'owner_acknowledges', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
